{"id": 76876757, "slug": "the-downside-of-the-yale-endowment", "title": "The Downside of the Yale Endowment Model - part 1", "subtitle": "aka \"What happens when you are 70% long illiquid beta and the fed tightens.\"", "post_date": "2022-10-06T18:06:02.558Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 222, "reaction_count": 1, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 1}, "body_html": "<p>As far as we can see, the downside of the <a href=\"https://www.institutionalinvestor.com/article/b1gj523tmfl2tt/David-Swensen-Is-Great-for-Yale-Is-He-Horrible-for-Investing\">Dale Swensen's Yale endowment</a> portfolio model is it's overweight illiquid, long duration assets like PE/VC. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ldUT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b5f53ae-6124-4211-a6b2-c49b13b820ea_1132x760.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ldUT!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b5f53ae-6124-4211-a6b2-c49b13b820ea_1132x760.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ldUT!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b5f53ae-6124-4211-a6b2-c49b13b820ea_1132x760.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ldUT!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b5f53ae-6124-4211-a6b2-c49b13b820ea_1132x760.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ldUT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_