eWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Image&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Image\" title=\"Image\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rMSq!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F37769086-9cc3-4685-9534-62d6b9e89415_1210x468.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rMSq!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F37769086-9cc3-4685-9534-62d6b9e89415_1210x468.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rMSq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F37769086-9cc3-4685-9534-62d6b9e89415_1210x468.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!rMSq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F37769086-9cc3-4685-9534-62d6b9e89415_1210x468.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>What happens to 'dry powder' when LPs can't make capital calls?</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/EdConwaySky/status/1575128310740389889?s=20&amp;t=7UHiXhpLYg2DjzMMjXDhxw&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;\ud83d\udea8NEW\ud83d\udea8\\nOn the <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@bankofengland</span> intervention:\\nAm told the BoE were responding to a \u201crun dynamic\u201d on pension funds - a wholesale equivalent of the run which destroyed Northern Rock.\\nHad they not intervened, there would have been mass insolvencies of pension funds by THIS AFTERNOON.&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;EdConwaySky&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Ed Conway&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Wed Sep 28 14:20:28 +0000 2022&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:9588,&quot;like_count&quot;:22438,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p><a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/articles/venture-capitals-cash-stockpile-swells-amid-slowdown-11660125600\">$540bn of dry powder according to WSJ</a>.  But a lot of that capital still needs to be <a href=\"https://carta.com/blog/capital-call/\">called</a>.</p><p>Asset / Liability management is important, but mark to market losses get realized today if liquidity for financial players comes under stress.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/abcampbell/status/1575591369489649664?s=20&amp;t=7UHiXhpLYg2DjzMMjXDhxw&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;abcampbell&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Campbell&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Thu Sep 29 21:00:30 +0000 2022&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;U.S. pension plans are also facing margin calls\\n\\nPensions managed by consulting firm and insurance brokerage Willis Towers Watson have posted tens of millions of dollars in collateral over the course of this year as bond prices have fallen\\n\\nhttps://t.co/ottM1HcBCL&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;GunjanJS&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Gunjan Banerji&quot;},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:1,&quot;like_count&quot;:2,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>So what happens to those long duration portfolios when when dollar strength forces EM central banks to sell reserves (aka liquidate treasuries) and that drives up US interest rates further? </p><p>Right on cue..</p><p></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/